---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact — cloudspaces.gr" description="Get in touch with a data and ML platform engineer.">

  <section class="contact-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="contact-title">Let's talk.</h1>
      <p class="contact-sub">
        Whether you're building a data platform, thinking about ML infrastructure, 
        or just want to exchange ideas about Kubernetes and Apache ecosystems — 
        I'm always open to a good conversation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="glow-divider"></div>

  <section class="contact-body">
    <div class="container contact-grid">

      <!-- LEFT -->
      <div class="contact-main">

        <div class="email-block">
          <p class="email-label">Best way to reach me</p>
          <a href="mailto:m@cloudspaces.gr" class="email-address">
            m@cloudspaces.gr
            <span class="email-icon">→</span>
          </a>
          <p class="email-note">I read every email. I reply to almost all of them.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="topics">
          <p class="topics-label">Good reasons to write</p>
          <div class="topics-grid">
            {[
              { icon: '🏗️', title: 'Data platform architecture', desc: 'Kafka, Hadoop, Iceberg, Dremio, Cloudera — architecture decisions, trade-offs, war stories.' },
              { icon: '⎈',  title: 'Kubernetes for data workloads', desc: 'Running stateful data platform components on K8s, EKS, resource management patterns.' },
              { icon: '🤖', title: 'ML platform questions', desc: 'Getting started with MLflow, Kubeflow, SageMaker. Happy to learn together.' },
              { icon: '🐧', title: 'Linux & infrastructure', desc: 'OS hardening, networking, anything deep systems. My oldest love.' },
              { icon: '💼', title: 'Work opportunities', desc: 'Consulting, contract, or full-time. Remote-friendly. Interesting problems only.' },
              { icon: '✍️', title: 'Blog topics', desc: 'Something you want me to write about? Tell me. I take requests.' },
            ].map(({ icon, title, desc }) => (
              <div class="topic-card">
                <span class="topic-icon">{icon}</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="topic-title">{title}</p>
                  <p class="topic-desc">{desc}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT -->
      <aside class="contact-aside">

        <div class="aside-block">
          <h3 class="aside-h">Response time</h3>
          <p class="aside-p">Usually within 24-48 hours on weekdays. Longer if I'm fighting a Kafka partition reassignment in production.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="aside-block">
          <h3 class="aside-h">What I'm open to</h3>
          <ul class="open-list">
            <li>Platform engineering consulting</li>
            <li>Data infrastructure reviews</li>
            <li>Technical writing collaboration</li>
            <li>Full-time remote roles</li>
            <li>Conference talks & podcasts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="aside-block">
          <h3 class="aside-h">Location</h3>
          <p class="aside-p">Greece 🇬🇷<br/>Remote-first, open to async collaboration across timezones.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="mailto:m@cloudspaces.gr" class="cta-email btn btn--primary">
          Send an email →
        </a>

      </aside>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.contact-hero { padding: 80px 0 48px; }
.contact-title { font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.contact-sub { font-size: 17px; color: var(--text2); max-width: 520px; line-height: 1.75; font-weight: 300; }

.contact-body { padding: 56px 0 80px; }
.contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }

/* EMAIL */
.email-block { margin-bottom: 52px; }
.email-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 14px; }
.email-address {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0,212,170,0.2);
  padding-bottom: 4px;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.email-address:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.email-icon { font-size: 20px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
.email-address:hover .email-icon { transform: translateX(4px); }
.email-note { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 10px; }

/* TOPICS */
.topics-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 18px; }
.topics-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
.topic-card {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  transition: border-color 0.2s;
}
.topic-card:hover { border-color: var(--border2); }
.topic-icon { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.topic-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.topic-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.6; }

/* ASIDE */
.aside-block { background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.aside-h { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text3); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.aside-p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.65; }

.open-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
.open-list li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); padding-left: 14px; position: relative; }
.open-list li::before { content: '·'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1; top: 1px; }

.cta-email { display: flex; justify-content: center; width: 100%; margin-top: 4px; }

@media (max-width: 780px) {
  .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact-aside { order: -1; }
  .topics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
